==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|saterdach|lang=dum}}, calque of {{etyl|la|nl}} {{term|dies Saturni|lang=la}}. Compare Low German {{term|Saterdag|lang=nds}}, West Frisian {{term|saterdei|lang=fy}}, English {{term|Saturday|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈzaːtərˌdɑx/|lang=nl}}
*{{audio|Nl-zaterdag.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-:en|zaterdagje}}

# [[Saturday]]

